	(descr "New footprint (2026-10), JAE MX34R36HF4T angle SMT pin header 2x18 (MX34 series), from JAE product information MB-0240-1 (Nov 2011, drawing SJ110669) PCB layout (ref.): 36 pads 0.7x4.8 at 1.1 pitch (38.5 span), hold-downs 47.5 apart: 2.0x7.0 land with 3 holes 1.2 (3.7 span), middle hole 9.8 in front of the pads' front edge (y 12.2). Numbering from the front-view terminal numbers: upper row 1-18 and lower row 19-36, both counted right to left looking into the mating face; mating face towards +Y. 3D model: JAE STEP SJ110669_MX34R36HF4T_V1 (supplied by Jonas 2026-10-20), SolidWorks Y-up; placed by its hold-down pegs on the three holes and the lead feet on the pads")
